@prefix ex: <urn:test:owl-dl:> .
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .

<urn:test:owl-dl:unsatisfiable-classes> a owl:Ontology .
ex:A a owl:Class ; owl:disjointWith ex:B .
ex:B a owl:Class .
ex:Impossible a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf ex:A, ex:B .
ex:AlsoImpossible a owl:Class ; owl:equivalentClass ex:Impossible .
ex:Possible a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf ex:A .
